            "remarks": "Name the supplier of every component, the entity that creates, defines and identifies it (an NTIA minimum data field); placeholders such as NOASSERTION do not count. SPDX 2.x: set packages\\[\\].supplier (PackageSupplier), e.g. \"Organization: Example Ltd\", or packages\\[\\].originator (PackageOriginator); a NOASSERTION value is read as absent.",
